    "long_instructions": "##Build Your Own Feedback Bot\r\nDesign a chatbot that will give you useful feedback on your Thinking Critically about AI guide.\r\n\r\n1. Decide what kind of feedback would help you most and who you would want it from.\r\n\r\n>For example: a skeptical peer, a younger student, an AI expert\r\n\r\n2. Fill in the system prompt: who is this bot and what should it do with your guide?\r\n3. Test it by sharing a section of your guide.\r\n4. If the feedback is not useful, fix your system prompt and try again.",
